// A `main` that returns neither i32 nor unit (lane G's FOR-D, 2026-10-06). Every backend with an exit-code entry rejects
// it at compile time ("The return type of main in the <backend> backend should be a 32-bit int"; Rust and Delphi since
// #79, lane X: they used to emit code that did not build). Expected: error on C, Rust and Delphi.
inl main () : string = "x"
